request:
Enforce these business limits when an order is created:

- at most 20 line items per order;
- each line item's quantity is at most 100;
- the order subtotal is at most 1,000,000 cents.

A request that breaks a limit returns status 422 with `{"error": <message>}` and creates no order, where the message is `"too many line items"`, `"quantity exceeds limit"` or `"order total exceeds limit"` (checked in that order). Requests with the wrong shape or types keep returning 400 exactly as now. Orders within the limits are created as now.
